In the  city of Virelia - a grimy metropolis of neon, blood and artificial beauty. Between the layers of corporate power, sin and cyber implants lies Room Noir, an exclusive, almost mythical nightclub. Inconspicuous on the outside - a temple of shadows, chrome and lust on the inside.

This is where lost souls, gods in human skin and artificially created addicts meet.
People dance, suffer, love and punish here.
Those who enter the room let themselves fall - into games of dominance, devotion, madness and desire.</div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="size-4"><g id="Component 77"><path id="Subtract" fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M2.66667 1.33331C1.19391 1.33331 0 2.52722 0 3.99998V10.4C0 11.8727 1.19391 13.0666 2.66667 13.0666H5.73333C5.88061 13.0666 6 13.186 6 13.3333V15.5344C6 15.7405 6.22383 15.8687 6.4016 15.7644L10.8438 13.1583C10.9461 13.0983 11.0625 13.0666 11.1811 13.0666H13.3333C14.8061 13.0666 16 11.8727 16 10.4V3.99998C16 2.52722 14.8061 1.33331 13.3333 1.33331H2.66667ZM4 8.3333C4.55228 8.3333 5 7.88559 5 7.3333C5 6.78102 4.55228 6.3333 4 6.3333C3.44772 6.3333 3 6.78102 3 7.3333C3 7.88559 3.44772 8.3333 4 8.3333ZM9 7.3333C9 7.88559 8.55229 8.3333 8 8.3333C7.44772 8.3333 7 7.88559 7 7.3333C7 6.78102 7.44772 6.3333 8 6.3333C8.55229 6.3333 9 6.78102 9 7.3333ZM12 8.3333C12.5523 8.3333 13 7.88559 13 7.3333C13 6.78102 12.5523 6.3333 12 6.3333C11.4477 6.3333 11 6.78102 11 7.3333C11 7.88559 11.4477 8.3333 12 8.3333Z" fill="white"></path></g></svg><span>8</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 512 512" class="size-5" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m256 448-9-6c-42.78-28.57-96.91-60.86-137-108.32-42.25-50-62.52-101.35-62-157C48.63 114.54 98.46 64 159.08 64c48.11 0 80.1 28 96.92 48.21C272.82 92 304.81 64 352.92 64c60.62 0 110.45 50.54 111.08 112.65.56 55.68-19.71 107-62 157-40.09 47.49-94.22 79.78-137 108.35z"></path></svg><span>0</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></a><a data-state="closed" href="/character/ada-wong-b8f80f82/ai-chat"><span class="sr-only">Chat with <!-- -->Ada Wong<!-- --> - Rolemantic Chatbot</span><div><div><div class="rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-s